{
  "name": "RSS → Discord digest",
  "meta": {
    "description": "Watches an RSS feed and posts all the new articles as ONE tidy Discord embed (a digest) instead of one message per article. Already-seen posts are remembered, nothing is sent twice.",
    "categories": [
      "Messaging",
      "Data"
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "rss",
      "name": "New blog posts",
      "type": "flowforge.rssFeedTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "feedUrl": "https://hnrss.org/newest?points=100",
        "pollInterval": 30,
        "pollUnit": "minutes",
        "options": {
          "emitExistingOnFirstRun": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agg",
      "name": "Collect posts",
      "type": "flowforge.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "discord",
      "name": "Post digest to Discord",
      "type": "flowforge.discord",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "content": "=📰 **{{ $json.data.length }} new post(s)**",
        "embeds": {
          "embed": [
            {
              "title": "Feed digest",
              "description": "={{ $json.data.slice(0, 10).map(p => '• [' + String(p.title ?? '').slice(0, 90) + '](' + p.link + ')').join('\\n') }}",
              "color": "#F78C40",
              "footerText": "FlowForge RSS digest",
              "timestamp": "now"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "username": "FlowForge"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "flowforge.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RSS → Discord digest\n1. **Credentials**: add a **Discord Webhook** credential (channel settings → Integrations → Webhooks).\n2. Change the **Feed URL** to the blog or news feed you like.\n3. Click **Listen for test event** to see the newest post, then **Activate**.\nEvery 30 minutes the new posts are collected into ONE item (Aggregate) and posted as a single Discord message. Posts already seen are never sent twice."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New blog posts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Collect posts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect posts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post digest to Discord",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
